### 0 cli render durations.x.md --format text
$ xmd render durations.x.md --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
# Chores :chores
- [ ] First @estimate(90s)
- [ ] Second @estimate(30m)
- [ ] Water plants @every(2w) @due(2026-09-16) → due today · ↻ every 2w
[watch] := stopwatch(31s) = ◴ 00:31 elapsed · ‖ paused
[alias] := watch = ◴ 00:31 elapsed · ‖ paused
[gap] := 1122s = 18m 42s
[total] := effort(chores) = 31m 30s

### 1 cli query durations.x.md [30s + 1m, 1m / 2, 0.5m, watch.elapsed > 30s, 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00 + 45s, 2026-09-16T14:00:45-04:00 - 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00, 2026-09-17 - 2026-09-16, effort(chores), now() - now(), now(), watch.elapsed - alias.elapsed] --json --now 2026-09-16T14:00:45-04:00
