### 2 cli query durations.x.md 2026-09-16 + 1s --json
$ xmd query durations.x.md 2026-09-16 + 1s --json --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 1
--- stderr
xmd: A date requires whole-day durations; use a date/time for hours (Date + Duration)

### 3 cli query durations.x.md tasks | where leaf | select {title, estimate, due} --json
$ xmd query durations.x.md tasks | where leaf | select {title, estimate, due} --json --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[
  {
    "due": null,
